A WebSocket. Auth is the same consumer key, in the query string rather than a
header, because a browser `WebSocket` cannot set one.

**Client → server**

```json
{ "op": "subscribe",   "topics": ["player:<puuid>", "patch"] }
{ "op": "unsubscribe", "topics": ["player:<puuid>"] }
{ "op": "ping" }
```

